{"n": 117, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "117.webp", "text": "11 -\n\n1176000 CONVERTING CAR TO CATA.\nLYTIC CONVERTER\n— Cars Prepared for Catalytic\nConverter —\n\nDrive car on several tanks of unleaded gasoline\nprior to conversion\n\nor\n\npump out leaded gasoline** and run engine\nminutes after filling tank with unleaded\ngasoline prior to installation of the catalytic\nconverter and oxygen sensor,\n\nFill fuel canister with unleaded gasoline.\nDon’t perform any test steps with cylinder\nshutoff during check with BMW Service Tester\n— se@ nominal value microfiche.\n\nRemove exhaust assembly — see Gr. 18,\nInstall catalytic converter — see Group 18.\nExchange exhaust carrier on transmission.\nInstall oxygen sensor — see 11 78 510.\n\nInsert adapter (1) in fuel filler neck and install\nunleaded gasoline label (2).\n\nAdjust engine idle speed and CO level — see\nGroup 13.\n\nCheck function of oxygen sensor — see\n\n11:78 010,\n\n** Conform with fire prevention specifications\n\n1178010 CHECKING FUNCTION OF\nOXYGEN SENSOR\n\nUp To 11/86 Mode.\n\nUnscrew plug (1).\n\nScrew in Special Too! 13 0 100 and connect\nSpecial Too) 12 0 090,\n\nConnect BMW Service Tester\n\nMeasure CO level.\n\nNominal value: 0.2 to 1.2 % by volume.\nSee 13 00 054 for udditional information.\n\nPull off and plug vacuum hose (1) on pressure\nregulator.\n\nCO level rises briefly and is regulated back to\nthe original value immediately ~ oxygen sensor\nis working.\n\nFaulty:\n\nCheck power supply of oxygen sensor via relay\nto the wiring diagram.\n\nSee Group 13 for additional information.\n\nSince 12/86 Models:\n\nA. Checking Heating:\n\nDisconnect oxygen sensor plug.\n\nConnect ohmmeter on 3 and 4 (white lead)\nand measure resistance.\n\nNominal value: < 5 ohms.\n\n1 = Plug for sensor ground voltage\n\n2 = Plug for sensor positive voltage\n\n3 = Socket for sensor heating\n\n4 © Socket for sensor heating\n\nB. Checking Signal Voltage:\n\nPertorm “oxygen sensor voltage” status call\nin scope of DME self-diagnosis.\n\nValue is measured at idle speed with oxygen\nsensor connected and should be between\n0.05 and 0.85 Vv.\n\nOxygen sensor is not working or is faulty, if\na constant voltage between 0.3 and 0.5 V is\nmeasured.", "words": [["11", 0.4488, 0.0279, 0.4909, 0.0504], ["-", 0.4762, 0.0252, 0.4924, 0.061], ["1176000", 0.2594, 0.0696, 0.3075, 0.0802], ["CONVERTING", 0.3202, 0.0696, 0.3941, 0.0809], ["CAR", 0.3977, 0.0703, 0.42, 0.0809], ["TO", 0.4245, 0.0703, 0.4387, 0.0809], ["CATA.", 0.4422, 0.0703, 0.4752, 0.0809], ["LYTIC", 0.3212, 0.0855, 0.3531, 0.0968], ["CONVERTER", 0.3566, 0.0855, 0.425, 0.0968], ["—", 0.3207, 0.1074, 0.3273, 0.1094], ["Cars", 0.3313, 0.1015, 0.3516, 0.1127], ["Prepared", 0.3546, 0.1015, 0.3961, 0.1147], ["for", 0.3997, 0.1021, 0.4129, 0.1127], ["Catalytic", 0.4169, 0.1021, 0.459, 0.1147], ["Converter", 0.3202, 0.1174, 0.3663, 0.1286], ["—", 0.3708, 0.1233, 0.3774, 0.126], ["Drive", 0.2584, 0.1492, 0.2837, 0.1605], ["car", 0.2867, 0.1525, 0.3009, 0.1605], ["on", 0.3045, 0.1525, 0.3166, 0.1605], ["several", 0.3202, 0.1499, 0.3506, 0.1605], ["tanks", 0.3546, 0.1499, 0.3799, 0.1605], ["of", 0.383, 0.1499, 0.3926, 0.1605], ["unleaded", 0.3967, 0.1499, 0.4387, 0.1631], ["gasoline", 0.4417, 0.1505, 0.4792, 0.1631], ["prior", 0.2584, 0.1678, 0.2817, 0.1777], ["to", 0.2852, 0.1671, 0.2953, 0.1764], ["conversion", 0.2984, 0.1684, 0.349, 0.1764], ["or", 0.2579, 0.1844, 0.2675, 0.1916], ["pump", 0.2579, 0.2003, 0.2857, 0.2095], ["out", 0.2888, 0.1989, 0.3045, 0.2076], ["leaded", 0.309, 0.1976, 0.3389, 0.2076], ["gasoline**", 0.3419, 0.1976, 0.3906, 0.2102], ["and", 0.3951, 0.1976, 0.4119, 0.2082], ["run", 0.4154, 0.2009, 0.4311, 0.2082], ["engine", 0.4347, 0.2003, 0.465, 0.2109], ["minutes", 0.2584, 0.2149, 0.2958, 0.2235], ["after", 0.2989, 0.2129, 0.3217, 0.2235], ["filling", 0.3252, 0.2129, 0.3526, 0.2268], ["tank", 0.3556, 0.2135, 0.3759, 0.2241], ["with", 0.3799, 0.2135, 0.4002, 0.2241], ["unleaded", 0.4043, 0.2135, 0.4463, 0.2241], ["